            "review_text": "Xuân Giao\n5 contributions\n0\nSan Fu Lou Restaurant\nFeb 2026 • Family\nI recently tried San Fu Lou and the food was quite good. The dishes were well-seasoned and served fairly quickly. The restaurant was clean and comfortable, making it a nice place to dine with friends or family. The price is a bit higher, but overall it’s worth trying.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 13, 2026",
